# T_SCRR: the item listing by ID on the screen, with x and then Esc typed
# during its first request: the x is dropped, and the Esc stops the run
# after that page with the message that it stopped; the form stays.
# Then the disposed items only, one page, with an Esc typed during it:
# that Esc is dropped, so the viewer opens, and the next Esc closes it.
# Then the same run with an Esc that is not typed ahead (on the K line
# after Ctrl-S): it closes the viewer.  Last all items to a file, with an x
# on a T line after Ctrl-S, which is not typed ahead either: the run ends
# whole and the x replaces the file name, selected as the form comes back.
K TAB TAB TAB SPACE TAB TAB CTRL-S
P x0078 ESC
S STOPPED
K STAB SPACE SPACE CTRL-S
P ESC
S VIEW
K ESC
S BACK
K CTRL-S ESC
S AGAIN
K SPACE TAB TAB TAB SPACE SPACE TAB
T RPT26.TXT
K CTRL-S
T x
S TYPED
K ESC
